{
  "id": "dmwaa7tcm6r01",
  "name": "数字步进器",
  "tags": [
    "表单",
    "交互"
  ],
  "summary": "数字输入框两侧 −/＋：点一下只走一步、按住 0.42 秒后才连续加减（每 0.09 秒一步）；到上下限按钮禁用，非法输入回弹。",
  "usage": "库存、名额、页数这类整数输入：用户常需要微调而不是重新打一遍数字时，桌面与移动端都可用。",
  "caution": "需要精确输入大数字（金额、编号）时别用步进器，直接给输入框；小数或量程很大的值用滑块 + 输入组合。",
  "hint": "点 −/＋ 调一步、按住连续加减；改成非法值会弹回并提示",
  "prompt": "【数字步进器】目标：数字输入框两侧各一个 −/＋ 按钮。点一下只走一步、按住要等 380–450 毫秒才进入连续加减（每 80–100 毫秒一步）；手输非法值回弹到上一个合法值；到 min/max 时对应按钮禁用。demo 范围 1–99、步长 1、初始值 12。\n\n1) 结构：.card > .head（标题 + 「1 – 99 件」范围说明）+ .stepper（inline-flex、高 38、圆角 10、1px 描边、overflow:hidden；内含 button.adj、input.num、button.adj）+ p.msg 说明行。范围由 MIN/MAX/STEP 三个变量控制，不要写死在按钮上。\n\n2) 两段式长按（核心）：pointerdown 时**立刻加 1 次** + 设 `setTimeout(420ms)`；超时后才 `setInterval(90ms)` 连续加；pointerup / pointercancel / pointerleave 三处都 `clearTimeout` 和 `clearInterval`。因为延迟 420ms > 350ms，短按（按下到抬起 < 350ms）必然只加 1 次，不会重复。每次「连续」的那一步给数字做 `el.animate([{scale:1},{scale:1.06},{scale:1}], 100ms)`；按下那一步不弹，避免闪。按钮按下反馈 scale(.94) + 底 text 6%。\n\n3) 输入处理：输入框自由打字，`blur` 或 Enter 时 commit——trim、Number()、必须是整数且落在 [min,max]，否则写回上一个合法值 `lastValid`，同时 .stepper 加 .bad（danger 描边 + 3px 光环）、抖 2px / 0.18 秒、说明行变 danger「只能填 1–99 的整数」，1.5 秒后恢复。↑↓ 键加减一步。\n\n4) 无障碍：两个 adj 按钮 aria-label「减少/增加数量」；输入框 aria-label + inputmode=numeric；说明行 aria-live=\"polite\" 播报错误。\n\n5) 坑：①长按必须三处清理（pointerup/pointercancel/pointerleave），漏 pointerleave 会把手指拖出按钮后一直加；②鼠标/触摸的 click 不要和 pointerdown 各加一次——用 `if(e.detail === 0)` 只接键盘触发的 click；③禁用要用原生 disabled，不要只加 class；④commit 要区分「空 / 非整数 / 超范围」三种情况，别用 parseInt 把 abc 解成 NaN 再写回；⑤输入框没有边框，焦点环画在 .stepper 上（:focus-within）；⑥控件保持只有 −/＋ 两个按钮的简洁形态。\n\n6) 配色：卡片底 color-mix(text 4% + bg)、描边 text 10%；步进器底 var(--ui-bg)、描边 text 15%、聚焦 brand 55% + 12% 光环、非法 danger；分隔线 text 12%；adj hover 底 text 6%、禁用文字 text 28%；说明行 --ui-text-dim / 错误 --ui-danger。\n\n7) 自动演示：只在 !window.__uiInteractive 时循环；首轮延迟 0.3 秒；每轮 setValue(12) → 短按 ＋（160 毫秒就松开，只 +1）→ 长按 ＋ 950 毫秒（420 毫秒后才开始连续，约再 +6）→ 点输入框填 120 触发回弹（红框 + 提示）→ cursor.hide()，1.5 秒后恢复 12；间隔 6.4 秒。\n\n8) 小视口：@media (max-height:420px) 里卡片 padding 10 13 9 / gap 9、步进器高 32、adj 32 宽、数字框 48 宽 / 字号 13、说明 9.5px，保证 176px 高里标题 + 步进器 + 说明完整。\n\n9) 使用场景：见 usage / caution。",
  "demoHtml": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<style>\n*{box-sizing:border-box}\nbody{margin:0;min-height:100vh;font-family:\"Segoe UI\",system-ui,\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif;color:var(--ui-text);background:var(--ui-bg);display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:24px}\n\n.card{width:min(300px,100%);background:var(--ui-surface);background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 4%,var(--ui-bg));border:1px solid var(--ui-border);border-color:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 10%,transparent);border-radius:14px;padding:13px 15px 12px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:11px;flex:0 0 auto}\n\n.head{display:flex;align-items:baseline;justify-content:space-between;gap:8px;flex:0 0 auto}\n.head b{font-size:12px;font-weight:600}\n.head span{font-size:10px;color:var(--ui-text-dim);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}\n\n.stepper{display:inline-flex;align-items:stretch;height:38px;flex:0 0 auto;align-self:flex-start;border:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 15%,transparent);border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--ui-bg);transition:border-color .16s ease,box-shadow .16s ease}\n.stepper:focus-within{border-color:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-brand) 55%,transparent);box-shadow:0 0 0 3px color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-brand) 12%,transparent)}\n.stepper.bad{border-color:var(--ui-danger);box-shadow:0 0 0 3px color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-danger) 12%,transparent)}\n\n.adj{width:38px;flex:0 0 auto;border:0;padding:0;background:transparent;color:var(--ui-text);cursor:pointer;display:grid;place-items:center;transition:background .12s ease,color .12s ease,transform .1s ease}\n.adj:hover:not(:disabled){background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 6%,var(--ui-bg))}\n.adj:active:not(:disabled),.adj.pressing{transform:scale(.94)}\n.adj:disabled{color:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 28%,transparent);cursor:not-allowed}\n.adj svg{display:block;width:12px;height:12px;fill:none;stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:2.2;stroke-linecap:round}\n\n.num{width:56px;flex:0 0 auto;border:0;border-left:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 12%,transparent);border-right:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 12%,transparent);background:transparent;text-align:center;font:inherit;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ui-text);outline:none;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;transition:color .16s ease}\n.num::selection{background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-brand) 22%,transparent)}\n\n.msg{margin:0;min-height:15px;font-size:10.5px;line-height:1.4;color:var(--ui-text-dim)}\n.msg.err{color:var(--ui-danger)}\n\n@media (max-height:420px){\n  body{padding:12px}\n  .card{padding:10px 13px 9px;gap:9px}\n  .head b{font-size:11px}\n  .head span{font-size:9.5px}\n  .stepper{height:32px;border-radius:8px}\n  .adj{width:32px}\n  .adj svg{width:11px;height:11px}\n  .num{width:48px;font-size:13px}\n  .msg{font-size:9.5px;min-height:13px}\n}\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){\n  .adj,.num,.stepper{transition:none}\n}\n</style></head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"card\">\n  <div class=\"head\"><b>库存数量</b><span id=\"range\">1 – 99 件</span></div>\n  <div class=\"stepper\" id=\"stepper\">\n    <button class=\"adj\" id=\"minus\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"减少数量\">\n      <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"/></svg>\n    </button>\n    <input class=\"num\" id=\"num\" type=\"text\" inputmode=\"numeric\" value=\"12\" aria-label=\"库存数量\">\n    <button class=\"adj\" id=\"plus\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"增加数量\">\n      <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 5v14M5 12h14\"/></svg>\n    </button>\n  </div>\n  <p class=\"msg\" id=\"msg\" aria-live=\"polite\">长按加减按钮可连续调整，短按只调一步</p>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n(function(){\n  var stepper = document.getElementById('stepper'),\n      num = document.getElementById('num'),\n      minus = document.getElementById('minus'),\n      plus = document.getElementById('plus'),\n      msg = document.getElementById('msg');\n\n  var MIN = 1, MAX = 99, STEP = 1;\n  var HOLD_DELAY = 420;     /* 长按多久才开始连续：380–450 之间 */\n  var HOLD_INTERVAL = 90;   /* 连续时的间隔：80–100 之间 */\n  var DEFAULT = '长按加减按钮可连续调整，短按只调一步';\n\n  var value = 12, lastValid = 12;\n  var timer = null, cursor = null, msgTimer = null;\n  var holdTimer = null, holdInterval = null, pressBtn = null;\n\n  function clamp(v){ return Math.max(MIN, Math.min(MAX, v)); }\n\n  function paint(){\n    num.value = String(value);\n    minus.disabled = value <= MIN;\n    plus.disabled = value >= MAX;\n  }\n\n  function setValue(v){\n    value = clamp(v);\n    lastValid = value;\n    paint();\n    msg.className = 'msg';\n    msg.textContent = DEFAULT;\n  }\n\n  function pulseNum(){\n    if(!num.animate) return;\n    num.animate(\n      [{ transform: 'scale(1)' }, { transform: 'scale(1.06)' }, { transform: 'scale(1)' }],\n      { duration: 100, easing: 'ease-out' }\n    );\n  }\n\n  function bump(dir, repeat){\n    var next = clamp(value + dir * STEP);\n    if(next === value) return false;\n    setValue(next);\n    if(repeat) pulseNum();\n    return true;\n  }\n\n  function flashBad(text){\n    stepper.classList.add('bad');\n    msg.className = 'msg err';\n    msg.textContent = text;\n    if(stepper.animate){\n      stepper.animate([\n        { transform: 'translateX(0)' }, { transform: 'translateX(-2px)' },\n        { transform: 'translateX(2px)' }, { transform: 'translateX(0)' }\n      ], { duration: 180, easing: 'ease-out' });\n    }\n    if(msgTimer) clearTimeout(msgTimer);\n    msgTimer = setTimeout(function(){\n      stepper.classList.remove('bad');\n      msg.className = 'msg';\n      msg.textContent = DEFAULT;\n    }, 1500);\n  }\n\n  function commit(){\n    var raw = num.value.trim();\n    var v = Number(raw);\n    if(!raw || !isFinite(v) || Math.floor(v) !== v || v < MIN || v > MAX){\n      num.value = String(lastValid);\n      flashBad('只能填 ' + MIN + '–' + MAX + ' 的整数');\n      return;\n    }\n    setValue(v);\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- 两段式长按：先等 420ms 才进入连续，短按只走一步 ---------- */\n  function beginPress(dir, btn){\n    if(!btn || btn.disabled) return;\n    pressBtn = btn;\n    btn.classList.add('pressing');\n    bump(dir, false);                        /* 按下立刻加 1 次 */\n    if(holdTimer) clearTimeout(holdTimer);\n    if(holdInterval) clearInterval(holdInterval);\n    holdTimer = setTimeout(function(){\n      holdTimer = null;\n      holdInterval = setInterval(function(){\n        if(!bump(dir, true)){ stopPress(btn); }   /* 到边界就停，接着给 scale 反馈 */\n      }, HOLD_INTERVAL);\n    }, HOLD_DELAY);\n  }\n\n  function stopPress(btn){\n    if(holdTimer){ clearTimeout(holdTimer); holdTimer = null; }\n    if(holdInterval){ clearInterval(holdInterval); holdInterval = null; }\n    var target = btn || pressBtn;\n    if(target) target.classList.remove('pressing');\n    pressBtn = null;\n  }\n\n  [[minus, -1], [plus, 1]].forEach(function(pair){\n    var btn = pair[0], dir = pair[1];\n    btn.addEventListener('pointerdown', function(e){\n      if(btn.disabled) return;\n      e.preventDefault();\n      beginPress(dir, btn);\n    });\n    ['pointerup', 'pointercancel', 'pointerleave'].forEach(function(ev){\n      btn.addEventListener(ev, function(){ stopPress(btn); });\n    });\n    /* 键盘触发（Enter/Space）走 click，detail 为 0；鼠标/触摸的 click 已由 pointerdown 处理，避免重复 */\n    btn.addEventListener('click', function(e){\n      if(e.detail === 0) bump(dir, false);\n    });\n  });\n\n  num.addEventListener('keydown', function(e){\n    if(e.key === 'Enter'){ e.preventDefault(); commit(); }\n    else if(e.key === 'ArrowUp'){ e.preventDefault(); setValue(value + STEP); }\n    else if(e.key === 'ArrowDown'){ e.preventDefault(); setValue(value - STEP); }\n  });\n  num.addEventListener('blur', commit);\n\n  function ensureCursor(){\n    if(cursor) return cursor;\n    if(!window.__uiInteractive && typeof window.__uiDemoCursor === 'function'){\n      cursor = window.__uiDemoCursor();\n    }\n    return cursor;\n  }\n\n  function clickEl(c, el, cb){\n    if(!el){ cb(); return; }\n    c.moveTo(el);\n    setTimeout(function(){\n      c.press(); el.classList.add('pressing');\n      setTimeout(function(){\n        c.release(); el.classList.remove('pressing');\n        cb();\n      }, 190);\n    }, 560);\n  }\n\n  function demo(){\n    setValue(12);\n    var c = ensureCursor();\n    if(!c){ bump(1, false); return; }\n    if(c.el) c.el.classList.add('show');\n\n    function step3(){\n      /* 长按 +：420 毫秒后才开始连续，数字每次重复都轻弹一下 */\n      c.moveTo(plus);\n      setTimeout(function(){\n        c.press(); beginPress(1, plus);\n        setTimeout(function(){\n          c.release(); stopPress(plus);\n          setTimeout(step4, 260);\n        }, 950);\n      }, 560);\n    }\n\n    function step2(){\n      /* 短按 +：按下 160 毫秒就松开，只加 1，不重复 */\n      c.moveTo(plus);\n      setTimeout(function(){\n        c.press(); beginPress(1, plus);\n        setTimeout(function(){\n          c.release(); stopPress(plus);\n          setTimeout(step3, 220);\n        }, 160);\n      }, 560);\n    }\n\n    function step4(){\n      clickEl(c, num, function(){\n        try { num.focus({ preventScroll: true }); } catch(e){ /* 老浏览器忽略 */ }\n        num.value = '120';\n        commit();\n        setTimeout(function(){\n          if(typeof c.hide === 'function') c.hide();\n          setTimeout(function(){ setValue(12); }, 1500);\n        }, 760);\n      });\n    }\n\n    step2();\n  }\n\n  function stop(){ if(timer){ clearInterval(timer); timer = null; } }\n  function start(){\n    stop();\n    setTimeout(function(){ demo(); timer = setInterval(demo, 6400); }, 300);\n  }\n\n  paint();\n  if(!window.__uiInteractive) start();\n})();\n</script>\n</body></html>\n",
